<title>USA: AMB Financial to buy back 5 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>AMB Financial to buy back 5 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MUNSTER, Ind. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMB Financial Corp said Thursday it received Office of Thrift Supervision approval to buy back up to five percent of the outstanding shares of common stock in the open market over a 12-month period.</p>
<p>At December 31, 1996, the holding company for American Savings FSB had 1,067,919 outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased at prevailing market prices from time to time depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
